- `array`
     - **title**: Title of page
     - **url**: URL for page
     - **targetType**: Link type set via the "Enable Link" option in the page settings (``page``, ``article``,
       ``media``, or ``external``). Default to ``page``.
     - **children**: Child pages in the same structure (only returned by the ``tree`` functions)
     - use ``properties`` config to provide additional fields
